	(text "U1302 runs +3V3_D in RECORD mode. Pins 8, 11, 12 to GND: 1.4 + 1.6 + 0.2 + 0.1 = 3.3 V.\nEN = LDO_EN: the R1305/R1306 divider from VSYS keeps U1302 on at reset (EN <= IN + 0.4 V).\nU401 PC13 pulls LDO_EN low to turn U1302 off. U1301 PG drives BUCK_PG to U401 PD3.\nSCREEN -> RECORD: U1302 on, then U1301 off. RECORD -> SCREEN: U1301 on, wait for\nBUCK_PG, then U1302 off. Keep the overlap under 1 ms.\nC1311 22 uF 1206 keeps U1301 at >= 40 uF effective on +3V3_D (SLVSFP4B 6.3)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 163.83 119.38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "10af9566-585d-4ce2-a63f-e1ab394c28b4")
	)
	(text "ANALOG RAIL FILTER: +3V3_D -> FB1301 -> FL1301 -> +3V3_A"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 77.47 139.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
			)
		)
		(uuid "19a60979-eca1-4285-b990-e8db2db3bb6b")
	)
	(text "SCREEN MODE BUCK: U1301 TPS62913"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 66.04 27.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
			)
		)
		(uuid "5008e213-b538-484c-89b9-d18df3386b54")
	)
	(text "RECORD MODE LDO: U1302 TPS7A4701"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 223.012 29.21 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
			)
		)
		(uuid "74ca6ae6-4ae2-448f-bcdd-353766001ec0")
	)
	(text "U1301 runs +3V3_D in SCREEN mode (ECO-002). EN/SYNC = BUCK_SYNC:\nclock at 3 x fs = 2.1818 MHz = on and locked; held low >= 10 us = off.\nR1303 holds it low at reset, so the board starts in RECORD on U1302.\nR1301/R1302 15.4k / 4.87k: 3.330 V (VFB 0.8 V; R2 <= 5 kOhm, SLVSFP4B 8.2.2.2.6).\nR1304 4.87k on S-CONF: 2.2 MHz, no spread spectrum, no output discharge.\nC1308 1 uF on NR/SS: 10.7 ms soft start. Keep the FB node away from SW.\nL1301 Wurth 74438356022: 2.2 uH, Isat 5.2 A. Its core needs field qualification."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 26.67 116.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "cff3eef1-b2d1-47ee-b0fb-3829d27696b2")
	)
	(text "INTERFACES\nVSYS in: from the Battery, charger and USB-C sheet.\n+3V3_D out: U1301 in SCREEN, U1302 in RECORD, to the digital sheets.\n+3V3_A out: through FB1301 and FL1301, to the analog sheets and U401 VDDA.\nBUCK_SYNC in: U401 PB1 (TIM8_CH3N) through R404 on the MCU sheet.\nLDO_EN in: U401 PC13. BUCK_PG out: U401 PD3."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 176.53 144.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d9e38f6f-0170-420a-8552-6f5e375a23a3")
	)
	(text "FB1301 filters +3V3_D into +3V3_A_PRE; R1307/C1315 damp the FB1301 resonance (rule R57).\nFL1301 (NFM18, no ferrite) is the RF filter into +3V3_A: about -59 to -68 dB at 64/128 MHz.\nPlace FL1301 where the +3V3_A trunk crosses the AFE ring east wall.\nFB1301 filters the positive supply; it is not a ground connection."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 26.67 170.18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f4e705eb-2552-4644-b496-0ec434fc2338")
	)
	(text "3.3 V supplies"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 140.208 27.432 0)
