		(property "Function" "RECORD-mode +3V3_D linear regulator (ECO-002), VSYS in. ANY-OUT pins 8/11/12 to GND: 1.4 + 1.6 + 0.2 + 0.1 = 3.3 V. EN = LDO_EN from the R1305/R1306 VSYS divider (2.44 V at 6.2 V, 3.45 V at 8.77 V): on at reset; U401 PC13 pulls it low to switch off. NR C1312 1 uF; OUT C1311 10 uF only, so U1301 keeps 40-80 uF effective on the rail. 4 uVrms, PSRR >= 55 dB to 10 MHz."
			(at 222.25 62.23 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
