		(property "Function" "RF filter at the entry of the analog +3V3_A rail (ECO-002). +3V3_A_PRE (FB1301, R1307/C1315 damper, C1313, C1314, TP1303) in; +3V3_A (U1001 VCC, U502/U501, U401 VDDA, local caps, D1001) out. Same part as FL701, about -59 to -68 dB at 64/128 MHz, no ferrite. Place where the +3V3_A trunk crosses the AFE ring east wall, both GND pads straight into ring copper."
			(at 143.51 157.48 0)
