		(property "Function" "SCREEN-mode +3V3_D buck (ECO-002). EN/SYNC = BUCK_SYNC: held low (R1303 pull-down, >= 10 us) = off, clock = on and synced. Firmware drives PB1 TIM8_CH3N at 3 x fs = 2.1818 MHz (fs 727.27 kS/s), inside the 1.9-2.42 MHz sync range; every harmonic stays >= 587 kHz from 63.86/64/123.2/127.74/128 MHz. S-CONF R1304 4.87k (2.2 MHz, no spread spectrum, no discharge). FB R1301/R1302 15.4k/4.87k -> 3.330 V. PG -> BUCK_PG (PD3). Starts into the pre-biased rail when U1302 already holds it."
			(at 64.77 60.96 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
